  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Palestinian and Israeli civil societies and media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The intervention aims to creating a more conducive environment for sustainable peacebuilding by strengthening Israeli and Palestinian civil societies and supporting independent media in advancing dialogue, mutual understanding, and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Specifically, the intervention focuses on: 1) sustaining and amplifying the voices and actions of Israeli and Palestinian civil society - including community leaders, diaspora, youth, and women &#xBF; through initiatives that promote dialogue, reduce tensions, and foster mutual understanding within their communities and amongst different communities 2) supporting independent media actors in fostering a more pluralistic and informed public debate, combating disinformation, and facilitating collaboration with civil society to enhance peacebuilding efforts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
